        <body>
            <div xml:id="d447">

                <pb facs="0520" n="416" xml:id="pg416"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">793.94/4356: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in China (Johnson) to the Secretary of
                            State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Shanghai</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1932-02-22T14:00:00+08:00">February 22, 1932—2
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received February 22—7:30 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Rumors of despatch of Japanese reenforcements are becoming persistent. I hope
                    that the Department will find it possible to instruct Embassy at Tokyo to
                    express when reenforcements are sent they will not be landed inside Settlement
                    area.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Johnson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
